DTSTAMP:20260924T122623Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250515
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250516
SUMMARY:Pennsylvania: State corporate income/franchise tax return due
DESCRIPTION:RCT-101 due May 15 for a calendar year end. PA generally follow
 s the federal extension automatically\; Form REV-853 grants an extension of
  up to 60 days if not using the federal extension - a variable-length exten
 sion\, not a single fixed calendar date\, confirmed directly against REV-85
 3's own instructions. | RCT-101 due May 15 for a calendar year end. PA gene
 rally follows the federal extension automatically\; Form REV-853 grants an 
 extension of up to 60 days if not using the federal extension - a variable-
 length extension\, not a single fixed calendar date\, confirmed directly ag
 ainst REV-853's own instructions. | Authority: Direct fetch of PA's REV-853
  instructions this session: "you may file REV-853 to request a Pennsylvania
  extension of up to 60 days." Payment must still be made by the original du
 e date. | Source: https://www.pa.gov/content/dam/copapwp-pagov/en/revenue/d
 ocuments/formsandpublications/otherforms/documents/dpo-05.pdf | This date i
 s computed from a recurrence rule and may not reflect a later-announced cha
 nge\; confirm against the cited source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
